gametitle=Need for Speed - Most Wanted [Black Edition] (NTSC-U) [SLUS-21351]
comment=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 — Verified PCSX2 v2 Patch Suite for SLUS-21351 (CRC: 0518D274)

// Every static ELF offset below has been verified directly against SLUS_213.51 (Black Edition v1.01).
// Enable/disable individual sections inside PCSX2: Game Properties -> Patches.

[Widescreen 16:9]
gsaspectratio=16:9
author=PeterDelta (ported & verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Enables native 16:9 widescreen mode and corrects horizontal projection aspect ratio (0.71f -> 0.75f).
