patch=1,EE,0054BA38,word,3F400000

[Remove Brown Filter]
author=fobes
description=Disables the 2005 brownish-yellow visual treatment post-processing pass for clean, vibrant colors.
patch=1,EE,00550D58,word,00000001

[Remove Motion Blur]
author=PeterDelta (ported & verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Eliminates low-res PS2 accumulation motion blur that causes heavy ghosting/smearing at 4K internal resolution.
